Search for audio visual rental for trade shows and every result is an exhibit house: LED video walls, custom booth fabrication and stand design, aluminum truss structures sized to a 10x10, 20x20 or island footprint, interactive touchscreens and kiosks, laptop and registration desk computer rental, nationwide same day setup crews. That is a real business, and it is not what Malaga Event Gear is. We do not build booths, we do not stock a video wall, and we do not hang anything from a truss.

What we honestly do is narrower and, for most exhibitors, closer to what a single stand actually needs: the AV for your own stand's demo or presentation, not a full exhibit production build. A screen or projector for a product reel, sound sized to your stand's own footprint, a wireless microphone for a presenter, and ambient lighting for the area around it. If that is what you are looking for, [contact us](/contact/) with your stand size and what you want to show, and if what you actually need is a full booth build, this page tells you plainly why that is a different provider than us.

